OL,3,GNEWSA'Game-changing' suicide prevention
OL,4,Acharity expands
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter opening its first Devon club in
OL,7,FNewton Abbot in 2018, there are now 14
OL,8,Fclubs in the county. On Monday, the
OL,9,Fcharity is launching a new club in
OL,10,FIvybridge.
OL,12,FRoger Bond, from Plymouth, who went to
OL,13,Fhis first session when he was "in a
OL,14,Fvery dark place" about three years ago,
OL,15,Fsaid he had "never looked back".
